OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FAfter nine months of blood, sweat and
OL,7,Ftears, Ipswich Town find themselves
OL,8,Fback in the Premier League - and this
OL,9,Ftime they'll be more determined than
OL,10,Fever to stay there.
OL,12,FAfter sealing promotion at a jubilant
OL,13,FPortman Road on Saturday, attention
OL,14,Fcan now turn towards what the Blues
OL,15,Fwill have to do differently to ensure
OL,16,Fthat their return to the big time
OL,17,Fisn't as short-lived as their previous
OL,18,Fstint.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
