OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FHere are three things they'll need to
OL,7,Fget right to prove that lessons have
OL,8,Fbeen learnt..
OL,10,FIt's a sad state of affairs that money
OL,11,Fmakes the footballing world go round,
OL,12,Fbut it's true. Especially in the
OL,13,FPremier League.
OL,15,FIt's a ferociously competitive league,
OL,16,Fperhaps the most competitive in the
OL,17,Fworld, and it can eat you up if you're
OL,18,Fnot ready for it.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FIpswich certainly can't be accused of
OL,7,Fnot giving it a go last time, spending
OL,8,F#130 million on new players, but even
OL,9,Fthat wasn't enough.
OL,11,FDo they need more Premier League
OL,12,Fexperience this time?
OL,14,FTwo years ago, they targeted the best
OL,15,Fplayers in the Championship, like
OL,16,FJacob Greaves from Hull City, and Jack
OL,17,FClarke from Sunderland - no doubt with
OL,18,Fhalf an eye on having the safety net
OL,19,Fof a core of proven second-tier
OL,20,Ftalents should the worst happen.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FIt is possible they could opt to go
OL,7,Fdown the same route again, or they
OL,8,Fmight look to sign players with more
OL,9,Ftop-flight pedigree - be that in
OL,10,FEngland, or elsewhere on the continent.
OL,12,FWhatever road they take, it's going to
OL,13,Fbe expensive.
OL,15,FSpeaking of expensive, signings don't
OL,16,Fcome any more costly than a proven
OL,17,Fnumber nine.
OL,19,FAs the saying goes, goals win games,
OL,20,Fwhich is why strikers always go for
OL,21,Fthe big bucks.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FIronically, Ipswich had a very good
OL,7,Fone the last time they were in the
OL,8,FPremier League - Liam Delap justifying
OL,9,Fhis #20 million price tag with 12
OL,10,Fgoals.
OL,12,FCould we see him in an Ipswich shirt
OL,13,Fagain? He's certainly found first-team
OL,14,Fchances hard to come by at Chelsea.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
