FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FTown will have a decision to make on
OL,7,Fwhether to make Ivan Azon's loan move
OL,8,Ffrom Italian side Como a permanent
OL,9,Fone, but even if they do decide to
OL,10,Fpush the button, five Championship
OL,11,Fgoals wouldn't fill you with a great
OL,12,Fdeal of confidence that he has what it
OL,13,Ftakes to be the main man next season.
OL,15,FIt all points to Ipswich having to
OL,16,Fstrengthen significantly at the top
OL,17,Fend of the pitch if they're to have a
OL,18,Frealistic shot at survival, but you
OL,19,Fcan be rest assured that boss Kieran
OL,20,FMcKenna will be backed to the hilt by
OL,21,Fthe club's owners again.
OL,26,@oD@SrpoD@Xrw
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
