FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FGet the recruitment right, and there's
OL,7,Fno reason why Ipswich can't emulate
OL,8,FSunderland and Leeds United, who have
OL,9,Fboth shown this season that maybe the
OL,10,Fgap from the Championship to the
OL,11,FPremier League isn't as insurmountable
OL,12,Fas it once was...
OL,14,FIt's fair to say that Ipswich's home
OL,15,Fform has been real Jekyll and Hyde
OL,16,Fstuff over the last couple of seasons.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
