CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FIn their last Premier League campaign,
OL,7,Fthey only won once at Portman Road, a
OL,8,F2-0 win over Chelsea in December 2024,
OL,9,Fbut in the Championship this season,
OL,10,Fonly champions Coventry City have
OL,11,Ffared better.
OL,13,FClearly, to give themselves any chance
OL,14,Fof staying up, they will have to do a
OL,15,Flot better than last time - but they
OL,16,Fwill of course, take confidence from
OL,17,Fbeing so dominant at home in the
OL,18,Fsecond tier.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
