FL,309,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1777975509
OL,3,CIpswich Town back in the big time:
OL,4,CWhat do they need to do to stay there?
OL,6,FIt would obviously be a stretch to
OL,7,Frepeat that record in the Premier
OL,8,FLeague, but Sunderland are proof that
OL,9,Fbeing hard to beat in front of your
OL,10,Fown fans can give you a solid
OL,11,Ffoundation to survive.
OL,13,FIt took until February for a team to
OL,14,Fbeat them at the Stadium of Light this
OL,15,Fseason - a 1-0 victory for Liverpool -
OL,16,Fby which point they were well clear of
OL,17,Fthe dropzone.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
